#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40228"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF now."
msgstr "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF tem razão.\nVamos voltar ao #C000246204Meu Quarto#CDEF agora."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40764"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is right there.\nLet's #C000246204press on#CDEF."
msgstr "#C236196003BB#CDEF está logo ali.\nVamos #C000246204seguir em frente#CDEF."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "41784"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's go back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and rest."
msgstr "Obtivemos o #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nVamos voltar ao #C000246204Meu Quarto#CDEF e descansar."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42076"
msgid "Apocalypse Now!\nCome back soooooooon!"
msgstr "Apocalipse Agora!\nVolte looooogo!"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42544"
msgid "Surely you aren't thinking of WALKING back?\nDo you intend to make me march for no purpose?\nLook for that #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF!"
msgstr "Não vai querer voltar A PÉ, não é?\nQuer me fazer marchar à toa?\nProcure aquele #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF!"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "43456"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest."
msgstr "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF tem razão.\nVamos voltar ao #C000246204Meu Quarto#CDEF e descansar."

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "47684"
msgid "　Obtained\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Obtido:\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "47728"
msgid "Obtained"
msgstr "Obtido"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "549180"
msgid "We entered into a strangely cramped space."
msgstr "Entramos em um espaço estranhamente apertado."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "549884"
msgid "…that's #C236196003BB#CDEF!"
msgstr "…é a #C236196003BB#CDEF!"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "549980"
msgid "If we were in the Labyrinth, she could\neasily teleport away; but here, there's\nnowhere to \"run to.\""
msgstr "Se estivéssemos no Labirinto, ela fugiria\nfácil com teleporte; mas aqui, não há para\nonde \"correr\"."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "550164"
msgid "Ah, all done?\nWell done. You fought hard, Se-n-pa-i."
msgstr "Ah, já terminaram?\nMuito bem. Lutou duro, Se-n-pa-i."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "550772"
msgid "!? This is bad, Master!"
msgstr "!? Isso é ruim, #[Mestre][Mestra]#!"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551092"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF takes the sudden coordinated attack,\nand while being repelled away, manages to regain footing."
msgstr "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF recebe o ataque coordenado súbito\ne, mesmo ao recuar, consegue firmar os pés."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551216"
msgid "I'm sorry, Mother…\nI ended up coming late…"
msgstr "Desculpe, Mãe…\nAcabei chegando atrasada…"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551400"
msgid "Two… no, three people."
msgstr "Duas… não, três pessoas."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551524"
msgid "…Praetor, get behind me.\nThey have as much, if not more power than\n#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF…!"
msgstr "…Maestro, fique atrás de mim.\nElas têm tanto poder quanto #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF,\nou até mais…!"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552052"
msgid "I'm the brains,\nthey're the brawn.\nThese two are pretty strong, you know?"
msgstr "Eu sou o cérebro,\nelas são os músculos.\nEssas duas são bem fortinhas, sabia?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552356"
msgid "#C255045045Composite Heroes#CDEF…?"
msgstr "#C255045045Heróis Compostos#CDEF…?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552392"
msgid "That can't mean―――she's saying that\nthey're artificial Servants with the combined\nabilities of multiple Heroic Spirits―――!?"
msgstr "Não pode ser―――são Servos artificiais\nque combinam as habilidades de vários\nEspíritos Heroicos―――!?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553976"
msgid "Mother, umm…\nThe erosion has reached the third layer.\nYou'll let me have it, right?"
msgstr "Mãe, hum…\nA erosão já chegou à terceira camada.\nVai me deixar ficar com ela, não vai?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554064"
msgid "Do as you like.\nI'm only aiming for the Core."
msgstr "Faça como quiser.\nMeu único alvo é o Núcleo."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554188"
msgid "T…… thank you very much……\nI'll do my best…"
msgstr "M…… muito obrigada……\nVou dar o meu melhor…"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555124"
msgid "Wait and look forward to it, okay?\nSe-n-pa-i."
msgstr "Espere ansios#[o][a]# por isso, tá bom?\nSe-n-pa-i."

